  "title": "LeBron James Just Took the Biggest Discount of Any Modern Star",
  "subtitle": null,
  "byline": null,
  "publishedAt": null,
  "contentHtml": "<figure><a href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/%24s_!RpTP!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffb3f4d9c-536b-43ec-81aa-162150cf80d0_1546x1010.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n<img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/%24s_!RpTP!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffb3f4d9c-536b-43ec-81aa-162150cf80d0_1546x1010.png\" width=\"1456\" height=\"951\" data-size=\"normal\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n\n\n</a></figure>\n<p>Say what you will, but LeBron James still knows how to shake up the NBA world. Sixteen years after his <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Decision_(TV_program)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">original, earth-shattering move</a> from Cleveland to Miami, James <a href=\"https://www.espn.com/nba/story/_/id/49440164/lebron-chooses-76ers-sign-2-year-8-million-contract\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">made what he called</a> his “Last Decision” on Friday, <a href=\"https://x.com/ShamsCharania/status/2080677097463312412\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">choosing the Philadelphia 76ers</a> out of a <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/i/207921920/find-the-edge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">crowded field of suitors</a> on a two-year contract that contains an opt-out after 2026-27.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/subscribe?\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p>\n<p>My fellow Substacker  gets into the <a href=\"https://www.basketballpoetry.com/p/lebron-james-lands-in-philadelphia\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">X’s and O’s of LeBron’s fit here</a>, and  talks about the <a href=\"https://www.truehoop.com/p/four-quick-thoughts-on-lebron-to\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">pros and cons of these new Sixers as title contenders</a> as well. Certainly, the <a href=\"https://substack.com/@neilpaine/note/c-301027615\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">odds have moved dramatically</a> in the Sixers’ direction over the past month, through a combination of the <a href=\"https://www.espn.com/nba/story/_/id/49269428/nba-execs-react-boston-celtics-jaylen-brown-trade-philadelphia-76ers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Jaylen Brown trade</a> and now James joining a team that already included <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/tyrese-maxey-is-having-his-shai-gilgeous?utm_source=publication-search\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Neil’s Substack darling Tyrese Maxey</a> and the <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/is-joel-embiid-the-greatest-scorer?utm_source=publication-search\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">GOAT scorer when healthy</a>, Joel Embiid:<a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/#footnote-1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1</a></p>\n<p>\n          <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/lebron-james-just-took-the-biggest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n              Read more\n          </a>\n      </p>",
